1
00:00:00,280 --> 00:00:03,750
(Bernadette:)I love you, too. If I don't talk
to you before you go to sleep,

2
00:00:03,917 --> 00:00:06,987
(Bernadette:)-I'll meet you in dreamland.
-Good night.

3
00:00:07,921 --> 00:00:11,091
(Amy:)No, I will not consider sleeping
in my garment bag.

4
00:00:14,261 --> 00:00:17,501
(Sheldon:)Penny, did you ever wonder
how Starfleet captains--

5
00:00:17,664 --> 00:00:19,264
(Scene:)No.

6
00:00:21,601 --> 00:00:23,771
(Sheldon:)Well, now that
I've piqued your interest,

7
00:00:23,937 --> 00:00:27,387
(Sheldon:)welcome to the exciting world
of 3D chess.

8
00:00:27,541 --> 00:00:29,711
(Penny:)Why don't you just admit
you only want to play this game

9
00:00:29,876 --> 00:00:32,216
(Penny:)because you always play it
with Leonard and you miss him?

10
00:00:33,280 --> 00:00:35,890
(Sheldon:)You overestimate
his significance in my life.

11
00:00:36,016 --> 00:00:37,156
(Sheldon:)Hm...

12
00:00:37,384 --> 00:00:42,394
(Sheldon:)Do I miss how he makes a face
on my toaster waffle with syrup?

13
00:00:42,556 --> 00:00:43,866
(Scene:)No.

14
00:00:44,524 --> 00:00:48,664
(Sheldon:)Do I miss the way he fixes the zipper
on my jacket when it gets stuck?

15
00:00:48,829 --> 00:00:50,499
(Sheldon:)I don't think so.

16
00:00:51,231 --> 00:00:53,371
(Sheldon:)Do I miss how we say good night
to each other

17
00:00:53,533 --> 00:01:01,023
(Sheldon:)through the walls of our bedroom
using Morse Code?

